1
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:20,120
The darkness of 1997

2
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:22,640
seemed especially long.

3
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:25,160
I was trapped in this

4
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,600
long night

5
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:28,510
for a very, very long time.

6
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:30,440
I know

7
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:33,110
someone blocked the light

8
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:36,240
and buried the truth in the dark.

9
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:39,590
Since then,

10
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:42,390
I've had only one thought:

11
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:44,790
to light

12
00:00:44,790 --> 00:00:46,720
this suffocating darkness ablaze

13
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:48,880
with my own hands.

14
00:02:14,390 --> 00:02:19,270
[LIGHT THE DARK]

15
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:22,810
[Episode 1]

16
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:28,520
Safety first, prevention foremost.

17
00:02:27,740 --> 00:02:32,390
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant,
Late Summer 1997]

18
00:02:28,590 --> 00:02:31,250
Everyone is responsible
for workplace safety.

19
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:33,120
No gas operation is too minor
to take safety seriously.

20
00:02:32,390 --> 00:02:35,500
[Wugang Petrochemical
Gas Distribution Plant]

21
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:35,630
Unsafe practices can lead to disaster.

22
00:02:35,710 --> 00:02:38,800
All plant employees must strictly
follow safety regulations

23
00:02:37,030 --> 00:02:41,700
[Wugang Chemical
and Gas Construction Team]

24
00:02:38,910 --> 00:02:40,710
and operating procedures,

25
00:02:40,710 --> 00:02:42,870
stay alert at all times,

26
00:02:42,870 --> 00:02:45,240
and ensure safety
at every stage of production.

27
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,710
This rigorous approach

28
00:02:45,860 --> 00:02:52,240
[Improve Safety and Cut Costs;
Boost Efficiency Through Technical Innovation]

29
00:02:46,710 --> 00:02:50,030
will help safeguard gas transmission
and distribution.

30
00:02:55,590 --> 00:02:56,400
Ying.

31
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,020
You've been using this trick on me

32
00:02:59,020 --> 00:03:00,080
since we were kids.

33
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,030
So what?

34
00:03:01,190 --> 00:03:03,450
I can use this trick
for another 20 years.

35
00:03:04,310 --> 00:03:05,900
[Engineer Employment Contract,
Guangdong Petrochemical Plant]

36
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:10,620
[Engineer Employment Contract,
Guangdong Petrochemical Plant]

37
00:03:07,890 --> 00:03:10,080
This is the petrochemical plant
with the most advanced equipment

38
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:11,810
and best benefits in the south.

39
00:03:13,590 --> 00:03:15,380
I was the only person
from the Petroleum University's

40
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:17,980
chemical engineering department
they hired.

41
00:03:18,870 --> 00:03:19,800
Are you really going

42
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,280
to such a faraway place alone?

43
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,120
Of course.

44
00:03:23,190 --> 00:03:25,800
We are the ones who shape the world.

45
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:26,990
Ying.

46
00:03:27,079 --> 00:03:28,420
Mom and Dad have spent half their lives

47
00:03:28,420 --> 00:03:29,400
in the plant,

48
00:03:29,470 --> 00:03:31,079
as if the world consisted of nothing

49
00:03:31,079 --> 00:03:33,150
but the family quarters

50
00:03:33,180 --> 00:03:34,440
and the plant grounds.

51
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,550
I have to go out and explore.

52
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:40,880
Are you sure you've thought it through?

53
00:03:41,870 --> 00:03:43,070
What's wrong, Ying?

54
00:03:43,190 --> 00:03:44,790
Are you going to stop me, too?

55
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,000
I know your ID was confiscated.

56
00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:50,730
I just got it

57
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:52,960
from the filing cabinet in Mom's office

58
00:03:53,030 --> 00:03:54,190
for you.

59
00:03:53,450 --> 00:03:54,490
[Name: Chen Shan]

60
00:03:56,860 --> 00:03:57,740
[Name: Chen Shan]

61
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,560
You got it?

62
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:00,170
[Name: Chen Shan]

63
00:04:00,710 --> 00:04:01,960
I stole it. I stole it.

64
00:04:01,980 --> 00:04:02,860
Alright?

65
00:04:04,990 --> 00:04:07,470
[Advance the Plant Through Science and Technology;
Boost Efficiency Through Reform]

66
00:04:07,430 --> 00:04:10,590
May everyone come to work happily

67
00:04:10,590 --> 00:04:12,590
and go home safely.

68
00:04:12,590 --> 00:04:13,240
Shan,

69
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,030
come back!

70
00:04:21,950 --> 00:04:22,630
Dad.

71
00:04:23,950 --> 00:04:25,550
What's wrong with your neck?

72
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,280
Stiff neck.

73
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:29,020
Have you had breakfast?

74
00:04:29,020 --> 00:04:29,680
Yes.

75
00:04:31,020 --> 00:04:32,450
Ying's being transferred
to a different position.

76
00:04:32,450 --> 00:04:33,800
What are you doing here causing trouble?

77
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:34,920
Come with me.

78
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,390
I'm not going to the construction site.

79
00:04:36,390 --> 00:04:37,720
Where else would you go?

80
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:38,720
To heaven?

81
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,490
I don't even work at this plant.

82
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,590
You'll be assigned

83
00:04:41,590 --> 00:04:42,950
to the construction team soon.

84
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:44,430
Come with me and get the lay of the land.

85
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:45,120
Let's go.

86
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:46,510
I haven't had breakfast yet.

87
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:47,870
There's breakfast in the car.

88
00:04:47,870 --> 00:04:48,400
Let's go.

89
00:04:51,650 --> 00:04:56,610
[Construction Vehicle]

90
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,120
Dad, take care.

91
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:53,980
We're leaving.

92
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:14,160
Come in.

93
00:05:20,750 --> 00:05:21,510
Mr. Qi.

94
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,390
You're here.

95
00:05:26,390 --> 00:05:26,950
Well...

96
00:05:28,510 --> 00:05:30,170
Are you looking for my master?

97
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:32,370
She went out and will be back in a while.

98
00:05:32,630 --> 00:05:33,560
This bed

99
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:35,390
was wrecked by Shan.

100
00:05:35,409 --> 00:05:36,870
Why don't you get a new one?

101
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,830
I can fix it up and keep using it.

102
00:05:38,830 --> 00:05:41,120
It was from my master, after all.

103
00:05:41,790 --> 00:05:42,500
By the way,

104
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:43,840
Chen Ying,

105
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,310
if you

106
00:05:45,310 --> 00:05:46,510
need anything fixed,

107
00:05:46,550 --> 00:05:47,409
just come to me.

108
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:48,920
I can fix most everyday things.

109
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,560
Okay.

110
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:51,190
Master.

111
00:05:51,570 --> 00:05:52,180
Qi.

112
00:05:52,210 --> 00:05:52,840
Mom.

113
00:05:53,380 --> 00:05:54,640
If Ying needs anything to be fixed,

114
00:05:54,640 --> 00:05:55,560
she's got her dad.

115
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,960
Why would she come to you?

116
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,180
By the way, Qi,

117
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,190
make sure you

118
00:06:00,210 --> 00:06:01,510
get those design plans finalized.

119
00:06:01,510 --> 00:06:01,870
Okay.

120
00:06:01,870 --> 00:06:02,730
Let's go, Ying.

121
00:06:08,430 --> 00:06:09,610
Goodbye, Mr. Qi.

122
00:06:15,430 --> 00:06:16,680
Come back again if you like it.

123
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:17,280
Thank you.

124
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,970
I'll have a serving of Liangxia.

125
00:06:19,970 --> 00:06:20,640
Mom.

126
00:06:21,070 --> 00:06:22,140
Don't just eat dry food.

127
00:06:22,140 --> 00:06:23,270
Have some Liangxia.

128
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:26,450
Mom, what are you doing?

129
00:06:27,100 --> 00:06:28,820
I know my daughter is qualified,

130
00:06:28,820 --> 00:06:30,250
but sometimes you have to grease

131
00:06:30,250 --> 00:06:31,180
the right palms.

132
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,159
Our plant is undergoing
a major reform this year.

133
00:06:33,159 --> 00:06:35,040
Departments will be cut or merged.

134
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,520
Administration isn't a core department.

135
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,380
Who knows what will happen to it

136
00:06:37,380 --> 00:06:38,270
in the future?

137
00:06:38,430 --> 00:06:39,720
Everyone's after that accounting job

138
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,180
in the Supply Department.

139
00:06:41,310 --> 00:06:42,810
I have to make sure

140
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:43,970
nothing goes wrong.

141
00:06:45,870 --> 00:06:46,510
Mom.

142
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:50,510
Then I'm not going to work here anymore.

143
00:06:51,310 --> 00:06:53,430
Don't put on that same fake
moral high ground as your dad.

144
00:06:53,430 --> 00:06:55,190
You have to listen to me
when it comes to work.

145
00:06:55,190 --> 00:06:56,870
-Mom.
-Take it as my investment.

146
00:06:56,870 --> 00:06:59,000
I'm counting on you for my retirement.

147
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,870
Hurry up. The director is waiting.

148
00:07:00,870 --> 00:07:01,480
Hurry.

149
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:01,950
Mom.

150
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:03,000
Listen to me.

151
00:07:08,290 --> 00:07:14,260
[Construction Vehicle]

152
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:11,190
Those poor chickens and pigs!

153
00:07:11,190 --> 00:07:11,870
How dare you come back!

154
00:07:11,870 --> 00:07:13,000
How are we supposed to live?

155
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,260
How dare you come back!

156
00:07:14,350 --> 00:07:15,580
How dare you come back, huh?

157
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:16,640
What are you doing?

158
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,920
What are you here for?
How dare you come back!

159
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,750
What are you here for?

160
00:07:19,750 --> 00:07:20,480
How dare you come back!

161
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,190
What are you here for?

162
00:07:21,190 --> 00:07:21,950
Put everything down.

163
00:07:21,950 --> 00:07:23,000
Step back. Step back.

164
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:23,660
Put it down!

165
00:07:24,190 --> 00:07:25,520
Do you want to go to jail?

166
00:07:27,510 --> 00:07:28,610
I am here today

167
00:07:28,630 --> 00:07:29,830
to solve this matter.

168
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,420
If it's not solved,

169
00:07:31,510 --> 00:07:32,510
I won't leave.

170
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,940
Look at this teahouse.

171
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,710
It is considered Director Wan's

172
00:07:41,710 --> 00:07:42,909
second office.

173
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:48,610
[Noble as the Pine Wind,
Fragrant as the Orchid]

174
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:45,800
Thank you.

175
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:47,800
Wait.

176
00:07:50,810 --> 00:07:53,590
[Noble as the Pine Wind,
Fragrant as the Orchid]

177
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:52,680
Godfather.

178
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,390
Ying.

179
00:07:53,870 --> 00:07:54,730
Senior Sister.

180
00:07:54,830 --> 00:07:57,430
I've already talked it
over with Director Wan.

181
00:07:57,830 --> 00:07:58,680
Thank you, Junior Brother.

182
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,240
Don't mention it. We're like family.

183
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,160
Go on in.

184
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:04,200
[Noble as the Pine Wind,
Fragrant as the Orchid]

185
00:08:01,480 --> 00:08:02,070
Let's go.

186
00:08:02,870 --> 00:08:03,800
Go ahead.

187
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,160
Come in.

188
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:11,310
Wenying.

189
00:08:11,370 --> 00:08:12,570
Hello, Director Wan.

190
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,890
Hello, Director Wan.

191
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:14,940
-I brought the kid here.
-Hello. Hello.

192
00:08:14,940 --> 00:08:15,860
Please sit.

193
00:08:16,230 --> 00:08:17,940
Deputy Director Geng told me

194
00:08:17,960 --> 00:08:19,720
you want her to be an accountant
in the supply department.

195
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,480
Yes.

196
00:08:20,770 --> 00:08:21,570
Director Wan.

197
00:08:21,630 --> 00:08:22,940
You must be tired

198
00:08:22,970 --> 00:08:24,460
of drinking tea all day.

199
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:26,720
I picked up some ye'erba downstairs

200
00:08:27,090 --> 00:08:27,890
for you to try.

201
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,310
You're too kind.

202
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,080
Chen Ying, right?

203
00:08:34,730 --> 00:08:35,789
Hello, Director Wan.

204
00:08:35,789 --> 00:08:37,000
You've grown into a young lady.

205
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:37,669
Yes.

206
00:08:37,909 --> 00:08:40,570
You're working in administration
at the plant?

207
00:08:40,850 --> 00:08:42,210
I studied accounting,

208
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:44,130
but when I got into the plant,

209
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:46,240
there were no vacancies
in the finance department,

210
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,960
so I worked at the grassroots level
for 3 years.

211
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,000
I just passed the exam

212
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,740
for Certified Public Accountant.

213
00:08:50,740 --> 00:08:51,860
In our plant,

214
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:54,240
there are only two CPAs.

215
00:08:54,450 --> 00:08:55,730
That speaks volumes

216
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:57,360
about your ability to learn.

217
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,270
Yes.

218
00:08:58,600 --> 00:08:59,730
But for accounting,

219
00:08:59,790 --> 00:09:01,420
practical experience
is the most important.

220
00:09:01,420 --> 00:09:02,720
You're right, Director Wan.

221
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,730
I wanted

222
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:05,620
to put theory into practice, too.

223
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,420
I wrote a practice report.

224
00:09:07,450 --> 00:09:09,320
I wonder if you could take a look.

225
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:10,790
Sure.

226
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:14,320
Sorry, I forgot my reading glasses.

227
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:15,950
The title is...

228
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,880
Finance Digitalization Reform Plan

229
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:19,390
for the Supply Department.

230
00:09:19,390 --> 00:09:20,330
Director Wan,

231
00:09:20,660 --> 00:09:21,900
if Ying gets in,

232
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,660
we'll have one of our own

233
00:09:23,690 --> 00:09:24,820
established there.

234
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:25,780
If there's any news,

235
00:09:25,780 --> 00:09:27,310
we'll know it immediately.

236
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,510
Of course.

237
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:38,500
Sun Jie.

238
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:39,350
Well,

239
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:40,170
come to my office

240
00:09:40,170 --> 00:09:41,270
in half an hour,

241
00:09:41,750 --> 00:09:42,360
okay?

242
00:09:44,580 --> 00:09:46,460
What's with that look?

243
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,020
This family

244
00:09:50,020 --> 00:09:51,240
really has it rough.

245
00:09:52,070 --> 00:09:53,330
You did the right thing

246
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:55,810
giving them that money.

247
00:09:56,170 --> 00:09:57,290
Tell me more.

248
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:00,220
There's a family portrait

249
00:10:00,220 --> 00:10:01,580
hanging in their house.

250
00:10:02,310 --> 00:10:03,820
The old man is in a wheelchair.

251
00:10:03,820 --> 00:10:04,670
And the kid is holding an

252
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:05,730
admission letter.

253
00:10:06,340 --> 00:10:07,770
He was admitted in 1995,

254
00:10:07,770 --> 00:10:09,770
so he would be a sophomore this year.

255
00:10:10,090 --> 00:10:12,000
Their place was blown up like this.

256
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,610
It's only normal

257
00:10:13,630 --> 00:10:15,090
that they want more money.

258
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,240
Not bad.

259
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:19,680
Anything else?

260
00:10:20,130 --> 00:10:20,940
Yes.

261
00:10:22,730 --> 00:10:23,730
That guy just now

262
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:25,630
looks like a construction worker.

263
00:10:25,630 --> 00:10:26,820
He was wearing camouflage,

264
00:10:26,820 --> 00:10:28,050
and there was a toolbox

265
00:10:28,050 --> 00:10:28,970
in the corner.

266
00:10:31,130 --> 00:10:31,820
Look, their house

267
00:10:31,820 --> 00:10:33,250
was blown up like this.

268
00:10:33,450 --> 00:10:34,510
It'll take at least

269
00:10:34,850 --> 00:10:36,340
half a month to fix it.

270
00:10:37,220 --> 00:10:37,770
Dad.

271
00:10:37,940 --> 00:10:38,610
Did the money

272
00:10:38,610 --> 00:10:40,150
you gave them just now

273
00:10:40,420 --> 00:10:41,700
include their loss

274
00:10:41,720 --> 00:10:43,080
from stopping work?

275
00:10:45,540 --> 00:10:46,340
Shan.

276
00:10:47,220 --> 00:10:48,090
If you were this observant

277
00:10:48,090 --> 00:10:49,610
at home,

278
00:10:49,770 --> 00:10:50,730
your mom and I wouldn't have to

279
00:10:50,730 --> 00:10:51,940
worry so much.

280
00:10:52,730 --> 00:10:53,590
Anything else?

281
00:10:54,850 --> 00:10:55,730
One more thing.

282
00:10:57,090 --> 00:10:58,060
Dad, shouldn't you

283
00:10:58,060 --> 00:10:58,890
wash your clothes?

284
00:10:58,890 --> 00:11:00,690
They smell terrible.

285
00:11:00,710 --> 00:11:02,350
That's what being a man smells like.

286
00:11:02,350 --> 00:11:03,150
When you join the construction team,

287
00:11:03,150 --> 00:11:04,680
you'll smell worse than me.

288
00:11:13,300 --> 00:11:14,110
Well written.

289
00:11:14,940 --> 00:11:15,750
I definitely

290
00:11:16,300 --> 00:11:17,390
want to hire her.

291
00:11:19,110 --> 00:11:19,900
Kid.

292
00:11:20,660 --> 00:11:22,020
Your boss has put in a good word for you.

293
00:11:22,020 --> 00:11:23,230
You can relax now.

294
00:11:23,350 --> 00:11:24,470
Thank you, Director Wan.

295
00:11:24,470 --> 00:11:26,330
Thank you, Department Chief Sun.

296
00:11:26,550 --> 00:11:27,830
Sun Jie,

297
00:11:27,630 --> 00:11:33,310
[Gentle Breezes, Clear Skies]

298
00:11:27,850 --> 00:11:29,860
take Xiaoying
to get the paperwork done first.

299
00:11:29,860 --> 00:11:30,170
Okay.

300
00:11:30,170 --> 00:11:30,760
Alright?

301
00:11:30,820 --> 00:11:31,350
Sure.

302
00:11:31,350 --> 00:11:32,110
Wenying.

303
00:11:32,470 --> 00:11:33,470
Stay for a moment.

304
00:11:34,700 --> 00:11:35,700
Goodbye, Director Wan.

305
00:11:35,700 --> 00:11:36,830
Goodbye. Off you go.

306
00:11:39,630 --> 00:11:40,320
Sit here.

307
00:11:44,990 --> 00:11:46,420
Take this back.

308
00:11:46,520 --> 00:11:47,200
No, no, no.

309
00:11:47,300 --> 00:11:49,060
She's like my own kid. Come on.

310
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:49,860
Director Wan,

311
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:51,470
I can't keep owing you favors.

312
00:11:51,470 --> 00:11:52,420
How about this?

313
00:11:52,550 --> 00:11:54,020
Please pass this

314
00:11:54,300 --> 00:11:55,700
to Department Chief Sun.

315
00:11:57,860 --> 00:11:58,660
All right.

316
00:12:00,540 --> 00:12:01,830
Things are tense right now.

317
00:12:01,830 --> 00:12:03,760
Are there any mistakes on your end?

318
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:05,420
Don't worry.

319
00:12:05,450 --> 00:12:07,260
I've arranged everything.

320
00:12:14,300 --> 00:12:14,900
Boss.

321
00:12:15,590 --> 00:12:16,390
Come and look.

322
00:12:18,900 --> 00:12:19,390
I found

323
00:12:19,390 --> 00:12:21,060
the critical point of failure.

324
00:12:21,060 --> 00:12:21,630
Look.

325
00:12:23,630 --> 00:12:24,420
Let me see.

326
00:12:45,180 --> 00:12:46,180
That explains it.

327
00:12:47,190 --> 00:12:48,390
Look at this flange.

328
00:12:48,900 --> 00:12:51,100
It's like it's mixed with glass shards.

329
00:12:51,150 --> 00:12:52,350
When the pressure hits,

330
00:12:52,350 --> 00:12:53,970
it can cut the sealing layer on the spot,

331
00:12:53,970 --> 00:12:55,230
causing an explosion.

332
00:12:56,060 --> 00:12:57,110
Not bad, Shan.

333
00:12:57,300 --> 00:12:58,110
That's what an education

334
00:12:58,110 --> 00:12:58,940
gets you.

335
00:12:59,350 --> 00:13:00,180
What's the saying?

336
00:13:00,180 --> 00:13:01,990
Like father, like son,

337
00:13:01,990 --> 00:13:02,630
right?

338
00:13:02,630 --> 00:13:04,740
That's what you call each generation
surpassing the last,

339
00:13:04,740 --> 00:13:05,670
right, Old Chen?

340
00:13:08,990 --> 00:13:09,630
Yiming.

341
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:11,820
Take Shan back first.

342
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:15,260
Hurry up. Don't get in the way.

343
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:10,360
[Received from Wan Yang on July 17...]

344
00:14:17,060 --> 00:14:18,350
Keep it on high heat

345
00:14:18,390 --> 00:14:19,630
and let the sauce reduce.

346
00:14:19,630 --> 00:14:21,020
Once it's thickened, it's ready.

347
00:14:21,020 --> 00:14:21,510
Got it?

348
00:14:21,540 --> 00:14:22,860
Mom is back.

349
00:14:27,340 --> 00:14:28,470
Mom is back.

350
00:14:28,540 --> 00:14:29,470
Come and see.

351
00:14:29,470 --> 00:14:31,020
Shan is cooking today.

352
00:14:31,470 --> 00:14:33,450
See how good he is.

353
00:14:33,630 --> 00:14:35,470
Well, this is a surprise!

354
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:37,290
Can't I have my moment for once?

355
00:14:38,070 --> 00:14:40,400
Ying's successfully transferred today.

356
00:14:40,420 --> 00:14:41,940
And Mom worked hard to support her.

357
00:14:41,940 --> 00:14:43,090
Let us men hold down

358
00:14:43,110 --> 00:14:45,190
the fort in the kitchen.

359
00:14:45,870 --> 00:14:46,630
Take Mom to rest.

360
00:14:46,630 --> 00:14:47,060
Take Mom to rest.

361
00:14:47,060 --> 00:14:47,700
Okay.

362
00:14:47,750 --> 00:14:49,060
My son is so sensible.

363
00:14:49,060 --> 00:14:49,960
And my daughter is excellent, too.

364
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:50,820
Today is a good day.

365
00:14:50,820 --> 00:14:51,700
Add another dish for me

366
00:14:51,700 --> 00:14:52,420
to celebrate.

367
00:14:52,420 --> 00:14:53,340
No problem.

368
00:14:53,510 --> 00:14:54,390
Mom, go rest.

369
00:14:54,390 --> 00:14:55,420
Leave this to us.

370
00:14:55,450 --> 00:14:56,330
Okay.

371
00:14:58,540 --> 00:14:59,150
Alright.

372
00:14:59,150 --> 00:15:00,110
That's enough acting. You can go now.

373
00:15:00,110 --> 00:15:00,900
Really.

374
00:15:00,990 --> 00:15:01,780
Ying,

375
00:15:02,270 --> 00:15:03,820
Mom is so happy today.

376
00:15:03,820 --> 00:15:05,350
Should I just tell her?

377
00:15:05,870 --> 00:15:06,930
You can't tell her.

378
00:15:06,940 --> 00:15:08,260
What if Dad disagrees?

379
00:15:08,940 --> 00:15:10,470
Just sneak out tomorrow.

380
00:15:10,470 --> 00:15:11,180
I've already

381
00:15:11,180 --> 00:15:12,420
packed your things

382
00:15:12,540 --> 00:15:13,990
and put them under the bed.

383
00:15:13,990 --> 00:15:14,780
Okay.

384
00:15:14,930 --> 00:15:16,170
I'll listen to you.

385
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:19,910
Chen is back.

386
00:15:28,300 --> 00:15:29,020
You're back.

387
00:15:29,020 --> 00:15:29,990
Go take a look.

388
00:15:29,990 --> 00:15:31,270
Our son is cooking in the kitchen.

389
00:15:31,270 --> 00:15:31,590
Wenying.

390
00:15:31,590 --> 00:15:32,470
Dad is back.

391
00:15:36,470 --> 00:15:38,800
Come with me.
I have something to tell you.

392
00:15:51,820 --> 00:15:52,630
Wenying.

393
00:15:53,020 --> 00:15:54,420
Tell me the truth.

394
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:55,590
Did your design department

395
00:15:55,590 --> 00:15:57,180
check the construction materials

396
00:15:57,180 --> 00:15:58,940
against the blueprints?

397
00:16:01,270 --> 00:16:02,780
The alloy steel flanges for Project 713,

398
00:16:02,780 --> 00:16:04,300
which cost hundreds of yuan,

399
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:05,660
were replaced with

400
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:07,020
these carbon steel ones

401
00:16:07,020 --> 00:16:09,020
that cost seven or eight yuan.

402
00:16:09,020 --> 00:16:10,050
Does your design department

403
00:16:10,050 --> 00:16:11,710
have anything to do with this?

404
00:16:12,870 --> 00:16:14,350
What do you mean?

405
00:16:15,420 --> 00:16:16,440
What do I mean?

406
00:16:16,750 --> 00:16:18,300
It's a pipeline over 200 kilometers.

407
00:16:18,300 --> 00:16:19,470
If something goes wrong,

408
00:16:19,470 --> 00:16:20,900
how many people will die?

409
00:16:20,900 --> 00:16:22,270
Does it have anything to do with you?

410
00:16:22,270 --> 00:16:22,750
No.

411
00:16:22,750 --> 00:16:23,780
Why are you suspecting me?

412
00:16:23,780 --> 00:16:24,820
I have nothing to do with it.

413
00:16:24,820 --> 00:16:25,400
Really?

414
00:16:25,420 --> 00:16:27,350
I really have nothing to do with it.

415
00:16:29,270 --> 00:16:30,730
That's fine. That's fine.

416
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:32,900
It has nothing to do with you.

417
00:16:32,990 --> 00:16:34,300
Everyone on the construction crew
works under me.

418
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:35,020
I know how they operate.

419
00:16:35,020 --> 00:16:36,350
It has nothing to do with me either.

420
00:16:36,350 --> 00:16:37,570
Then it must be

421
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:39,350
Sun Jie from the supply department.

422
00:16:39,350 --> 00:16:41,060
He used to be Wan Yang's driver.

423
00:16:41,060 --> 00:16:42,180
He was one of Wan Yang's most loyal guys.

424
00:16:42,180 --> 00:16:44,470
I suspect there's
something fishy going on.

425
00:16:44,470 --> 00:16:45,700
Lives are at stake.

426
00:16:45,820 --> 00:16:48,480
I have to report this to the higher-ups.

427
00:16:49,660 --> 00:16:50,820
Today is a happy day.

428
00:16:50,820 --> 00:16:51,990
We have to celebrate for the kids.

429
00:16:51,990 --> 00:16:53,390
Don't make trouble for me.

430
00:16:53,390 --> 00:16:54,660
Even if the sky falls,
we'll talk about it tomorrow.

431
00:16:54,660 --> 00:16:55,350
Be good.

432
00:17:30,660 --> 00:17:31,390
Hello?

433
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:33,380
Something happened.

434
00:17:36,830 --> 00:17:37,500
Mom, Dad.

435
00:17:40,870 --> 00:17:41,910
Today

436
00:17:42,460 --> 00:17:44,070
is a good day for our family.

437
00:17:44,510 --> 00:17:46,010
I don't usually get a chance to speak,

438
00:17:46,010 --> 00:17:47,940
but today I want to propose a toast.

439
00:17:51,500 --> 00:17:52,500
Is that okay, Dad?

440
00:17:56,390 --> 00:17:58,260
Our son is proposing a toast.

441
00:17:58,260 --> 00:17:59,390
Good. Good.

442
00:18:00,110 --> 00:18:01,110
You haven't eaten yet.

443
00:18:01,110 --> 00:18:02,710
Our son is proposing a toast.

444
00:18:03,700 --> 00:18:04,700
For the first glass,

445
00:18:04,700 --> 00:18:06,030
I want to toast my sister.

446
00:18:06,030 --> 00:18:07,150
She

447
00:18:07,260 --> 00:18:09,460
earned her new position today

448
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:11,070
through her own hard work and smarts.

449
00:18:11,070 --> 00:18:11,980
This glass of wine

450
00:18:11,980 --> 00:18:14,030
is to wish Ying a bright future.

451
00:18:14,030 --> 00:18:15,740
I will always learn from you.

452
00:18:18,030 --> 00:18:20,030
Hurry up and get it. Go get it, quick.

453
00:18:20,900 --> 00:18:22,590
Mom, don't go.

454
00:18:22,740 --> 00:18:23,660
I have another piece of good news

455
00:18:23,660 --> 00:18:24,660
that I haven't told you yet.

456
00:18:24,660 --> 00:18:25,460
You

457
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:27,600
finally said something sensible.

458
00:18:27,600 --> 00:18:30,310
You should have learned
from Ying a long time ago.

459
00:18:30,310 --> 00:18:31,110
Ying.

460
00:18:32,030 --> 00:18:32,830
I

461
00:18:33,070 --> 00:18:34,220
always felt

462
00:18:34,220 --> 00:18:35,740
that you could do it.

463
00:18:37,660 --> 00:18:38,590
Your mom and I

464
00:18:38,630 --> 00:18:40,260
picked out a gift for you together.

465
00:18:40,260 --> 00:18:41,550
Come, take a look.

466
00:19:02,150 --> 00:19:03,070
We know

467
00:19:03,790 --> 00:19:05,630
that this watch

468
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:07,350
has a special meaning to you.

469
00:19:07,660 --> 00:19:09,030
But you're wearing it

470
00:19:09,030 --> 00:19:10,260
every day, running around

471
00:19:10,260 --> 00:19:11,660
and knocking it against things.

472
00:19:11,660 --> 00:19:13,830
It'd be a shame if it got damaged

473
00:19:13,830 --> 00:19:14,980
or lost.

474
00:19:15,390 --> 00:19:16,940
So we think

475
00:19:17,110 --> 00:19:18,660
you should keep it safe

476
00:19:18,790 --> 00:19:20,830
and wear this new one from now on.

477
00:19:22,070 --> 00:19:22,830
Take it.

478
00:19:24,420 --> 00:19:25,770
-Come on. Try it.
-Take it.

479
00:19:25,770 --> 00:19:27,010
It's a Seagull watch.

480
00:19:27,030 --> 00:19:27,690
Shoo, shoo.

481
00:19:38,630 --> 00:19:39,890
Thank you, Mom and Dad.

482
00:19:40,500 --> 00:19:41,310
From now on,

483
00:19:42,790 --> 00:19:44,110
I'll wear this watch.

484
00:19:45,310 --> 00:19:45,900
Good.

485
00:19:46,150 --> 00:19:46,940
Dad, Mom,

486
00:19:46,970 --> 00:19:48,840
we'd like to propose a toast to you.

487
00:19:48,840 --> 00:19:49,490
Okay.

488
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:50,500
Thank you, Dad.

489
00:19:54,460 --> 00:19:55,110
Hello?

490
00:19:59,730 --> 00:20:00,400
I got it.

491
00:20:01,180 --> 00:20:02,310
I'll be right there.

492
00:20:02,940 --> 00:20:03,790
What's wrong?

493
00:20:03,830 --> 00:20:04,550
Something came up with the team.

494
00:20:04,550 --> 00:20:05,590
I have to go there right away.

495
00:20:05,590 --> 00:20:07,650
You guys eat first. Don't wait for me.

496
00:20:09,390 --> 00:20:10,070
Chen.

497
00:20:13,070 --> 00:20:14,260
What's going on?

498
00:20:25,960 --> 00:20:27,740
Captain Chen, going out so late?

499
00:20:27,740 --> 00:20:28,590
Got something to do.

500
00:20:28,590 --> 00:20:30,350
Captain Chen, get in.

501
00:21:23,530 --> 00:21:25,420
[Station Entrance]

502
00:21:25,420 --> 00:21:27,210
[Waiting Room]

503
00:21:26,420 --> 00:21:28,220
Anyone want to stay at the hotel?

504
00:21:32,940 --> 00:21:33,500
Ying.

505
00:21:38,150 --> 00:21:38,790
Shan.

506
00:21:41,150 --> 00:21:42,220
When you're away from home,

507
00:21:42,220 --> 00:21:43,590
it's convenient to have a cellphone.

508
00:21:43,590 --> 00:21:44,030
No.

509
00:21:44,030 --> 00:21:45,070
This is too expensive.

510
00:21:45,070 --> 00:21:46,390
I can't take it, Ying.

511
00:21:46,590 --> 00:21:47,650
It's second-hand.

512
00:21:47,900 --> 00:21:48,870
When I have money in the future,

513
00:21:48,870 --> 00:21:50,070
I'll buy you a new one.

514
00:21:52,630 --> 00:21:54,550
When I get back from Guangzhou,

515
00:21:54,550 --> 00:21:56,350
I'll bring you the latest model.

516
00:21:57,230 --> 00:21:57,980
Okay.

517
00:22:00,070 --> 00:22:01,000
Thank you, Ying.

518
00:22:02,550 --> 00:22:03,310
When you get on the train later,

519
00:22:03,310 --> 00:22:04,640
call Dad.

520
00:22:08,940 --> 00:22:09,940
Where's the boss?

521
00:22:10,500 --> 00:22:11,310
Inside.

522
00:22:11,390 --> 00:22:12,150
Out back?

523
00:22:12,370 --> 00:22:12,890
Okay.

524
00:22:16,170 --> 00:22:16,850
Boss.

525
00:22:17,940 --> 00:22:18,630
Boss.

526
00:22:18,740 --> 00:22:20,270
I've closed all the valves.

527
00:22:21,350 --> 00:22:21,800
Okay.

528
00:22:22,140 --> 00:22:24,030
Then tell everyone to get to work.

529
00:22:24,050 --> 00:22:24,550
Alright.

530
00:22:24,550 --> 00:22:25,390
Be careful.

531
00:22:27,790 --> 00:22:28,310
Guys,

532
00:22:28,310 --> 00:22:29,570
the valves are closed.

533
00:22:29,660 --> 00:22:30,660
Let's get to work.

534
00:22:45,570 --> 00:22:47,460
Ying, go back.

535
00:22:48,560 --> 00:22:49,240
Got it.

536
00:23:01,510 --> 00:23:02,340
Hello, Shan.

537
00:23:02,940 --> 00:23:03,940
Don't speak yet.

538
00:23:04,150 --> 00:23:05,170
Listen to Dad.

539
00:23:05,060 --> 00:23:05,840
[Pressure Gauge]

540
00:23:05,390 --> 00:23:07,050
On this construction site...

541
00:24:33,980 --> 00:24:35,180
Where's the family? Where's the family?

542
00:24:35,180 --> 00:24:36,050
Here.

543
00:24:36,110 --> 00:24:37,710
Doctor, you have to save him.

544
00:24:40,030 --> 00:24:41,630
-Mom.
-Mom.

545
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:43,330
Be careful.

546
00:24:44,240 --> 00:24:44,960
Mom.

547
00:24:44,980 --> 00:24:46,300
W-Where's Dad?

548
00:24:46,920 --> 00:24:47,650
Where's Dad?

549
00:24:50,600 --> 00:24:51,330
It's okay.

550
00:24:57,540 --> 00:25:00,860
[Red Zone]

551
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:10,680
Dad. Dad.

552
00:25:11,500 --> 00:25:12,180
Dad.

553
00:25:19,940 --> 00:25:20,700
Dad.

554
00:25:22,460 --> 00:25:24,420
Dad, what're you saying? Dad.

555
00:25:24,420 --> 00:25:27,880
-Your mom...
-Mom!

556
00:25:28,070 --> 00:25:30,960
-Mom, Dad is calling you, Mom.
-Mom is here.

557
00:25:31,900 --> 00:25:32,580
Mom is here.

558
00:25:32,580 --> 00:25:34,740
-Mom, Dad is calling you, Mom.
-Mom is here.

559
00:25:34,740 --> 00:25:35,700
Mom is here. Dad.

560
00:25:36,830 --> 00:25:37,980
My dad is still alive.

561
00:25:37,980 --> 00:25:38,740
Doctor.

562
00:25:39,260 --> 00:25:40,070
My dad is still alive.

563
00:25:40,070 --> 00:25:41,070
Please save him.

564
00:25:41,260 --> 00:25:41,900
Save him.

565
00:25:41,900 --> 00:25:43,420
Dad.

566
00:25:43,840 --> 00:25:45,400
Dad.

567
00:25:45,940 --> 00:25:46,980
Save my dad.

568
00:25:47,280 --> 00:25:48,610
Please save my—

569
00:25:49,260 --> 00:25:49,790
Dad.

570
00:25:52,270 --> 00:25:52,900
Dad!

571
00:25:54,850 --> 00:25:55,780
Dad.

572
00:25:59,420 --> 00:26:00,310
Dad!

573
00:26:02,870 --> 00:26:04,030
Dad.

574
00:26:04,740 --> 00:26:06,420
Dad, wake up. Dad.

575
00:26:07,390 --> 00:26:08,180
Dad.

576
00:26:08,730 --> 00:26:09,790
Dad.

577
00:26:10,500 --> 00:26:11,210
Dad.

578
00:26:11,270 --> 00:26:11,800
Dad.

579
00:26:11,820 --> 00:26:12,420
Dad.

580
00:26:14,110 --> 00:26:15,240
Don't sleep.

581
00:26:17,630 --> 00:26:19,350
Dad.

582
00:26:22,770 --> 00:26:23,730
Chen.

583
00:26:29,960 --> 00:26:31,930
Dad!

584
00:26:32,990 --> 00:26:34,360
Dad.

585
00:26:37,950 --> 00:26:39,740
Dad.

586
00:27:39,150 --> 00:27:39,740
Come see

587
00:27:39,930 --> 00:27:40,650
what Daddy

588
00:27:40,680 --> 00:27:42,240
brought you!

589
00:27:42,430 --> 00:27:43,080
Look.

590
00:27:43,210 --> 00:27:43,800
Mom,

591
00:27:43,830 --> 00:27:45,590
Dad brought me a gift.

592
00:27:46,300 --> 00:27:48,510
This one looks like me,
and this one looks like Daddy.

593
00:27:48,510 --> 00:27:49,390
What about this one?

594
00:27:49,390 --> 00:27:50,550
This one looks like Mom.

595
00:27:50,550 --> 00:27:51,890
This one looks like me.

596
00:27:52,270 --> 00:27:53,340
Look.

597
00:27:53,800 --> 00:27:55,600
Put them together,

598
00:27:56,260 --> 00:27:57,690
and that's our whole family,

599
00:27:57,690 --> 00:27:58,490
right?

600
00:27:59,140 --> 00:27:59,820
Right.

601
00:28:19,630 --> 00:28:20,370
Dad.

602
00:28:28,700 --> 00:28:31,580
[Wugang Petrochemical
Construction Exhibition Hall]

603
00:28:36,220 --> 00:28:37,590
Is this the one you want?

604
00:28:39,030 --> 00:28:40,290
Do you know how to play?

605
00:28:40,420 --> 00:28:41,220
No.

606
00:28:42,390 --> 00:28:43,260
When you grow up,

607
00:28:43,260 --> 00:28:44,700
Dad will teach you how to play basketball.

608
00:28:44,700 --> 00:28:46,500
Then you can play with Dad, okay?

609
00:28:52,740 --> 00:28:55,730
[Wugang Petrochemical
Construction Exhibition Hall]

610
00:29:30,310 --> 00:29:31,110
Is it them?

611
00:29:31,110 --> 00:29:32,180
Yes, it's them.

612
00:29:37,150 --> 00:29:37,930
[Grave of Chen Fu, Beloved Father]

613
00:29:37,310 --> 00:29:38,370
What are you doing?

614
00:29:38,630 --> 00:29:39,350
What are you doing?

615
00:29:39,350 --> 00:29:40,210
What am I doing?

616
00:29:41,030 --> 00:29:42,450
The explosion blinded my brother,

617
00:29:42,450 --> 00:29:43,510
and you still ask what I'm doing here?

618
00:29:43,510 --> 00:29:44,280
Get lost.

619
00:29:49,010 --> 00:29:50,430
What exactly do you want?

620
00:29:55,790 --> 00:29:56,900
I'll sue you!

621
00:29:57,890 --> 00:29:59,060
Shan!

622
00:29:59,130 --> 00:30:00,220
Stop it!

623
00:30:00,300 --> 00:30:02,590
-Shan! Shan!
-Stop! Shan!

624
00:30:02,620 --> 00:30:03,970
What are you doing?

625
00:30:07,660 --> 00:30:08,720
What are you doing?

626
00:30:11,730 --> 00:30:12,790
Where is Shan?

627
00:30:27,380 --> 00:30:28,640
I got all the medicine.

628
00:30:34,550 --> 00:30:35,810
Is Mom feeling better?

629
00:30:37,320 --> 00:30:39,650
She should be fine
once the IV is finished.

630
00:30:40,660 --> 00:30:41,700
I ran into Ma Yiming's mom

631
00:30:41,700 --> 00:30:43,220
in the hallway just now.

632
00:30:43,830 --> 00:30:45,310
You take Mom home first.

633
00:30:45,330 --> 00:30:47,120
I'll go check on Yiming.

634
00:30:47,810 --> 00:30:48,740
Come back early.

635
00:31:02,350 --> 00:31:02,870
Hello.

636
00:31:02,870 --> 00:31:03,500
Hello.

637
00:31:03,640 --> 00:31:04,750
Could you tell me

638
00:31:04,870 --> 00:31:06,630
which ward Ma Yiming is in?

639
00:31:08,260 --> 00:31:09,420
Ward 10.

640
00:31:10,460 --> 00:31:11,260
Thank you.

641
00:31:12,930 --> 00:31:17,660
[Ward 10]

642
00:31:37,200 --> 00:31:38,170
Auntie.

643
00:31:40,180 --> 00:31:41,590
I came to see Yiming.

644
00:31:46,420 --> 00:31:47,810
What did the doctor say

645
00:31:48,660 --> 00:31:50,060
about his condition now?

646
00:31:52,550 --> 00:31:54,680
The explosion broke three of his ribs,

647
00:31:55,590 --> 00:31:56,450
and he suffered

648
00:31:57,030 --> 00:31:58,550
burns over his body.

649
00:31:59,830 --> 00:32:01,150
He was fine,

650
00:32:01,280 --> 00:32:03,550
and then suddenly he ended up like this.

651
00:32:07,630 --> 00:32:09,220
When they pulled him out,

652
00:32:09,830 --> 00:32:11,630
he was still dazed.

653
00:32:13,500 --> 00:32:15,220
He kept repeating

654
00:32:15,740 --> 00:32:17,550
"flange, flange."

655
00:32:18,680 --> 00:32:20,740
I don't know what he was saying.

656
00:32:33,310 --> 00:32:34,350
Mom is asleep.

657
00:32:37,980 --> 00:32:38,420
Come.

658
00:32:51,260 --> 00:32:51,900
Ying.

659
00:32:52,500 --> 00:32:53,150
Today,

660
00:32:53,150 --> 00:32:54,680
when I went to see Ma Yiming,

661
00:32:55,030 --> 00:32:55,790
I suddenly remembered

662
00:32:55,790 --> 00:32:57,940
the day Dad took me
to the construction site.

663
00:32:57,940 --> 00:32:59,590
He discovered a problem
with the flange fragments

664
00:32:59,590 --> 00:33:01,450
from the construction pipeline.

665
00:33:03,030 --> 00:33:03,980
Dad said,

666
00:33:03,980 --> 00:33:05,150
if something goes wrong with a project,

667
00:33:05,150 --> 00:33:06,030
three departments

668
00:33:06,030 --> 00:33:06,980
are bound to be involved.

669
00:33:06,980 --> 00:33:08,310
First, the design department.

670
00:33:08,310 --> 00:33:09,640
Your mom's department.

671
00:33:10,070 --> 00:33:11,550
Is her blueprint planning

672
00:33:11,830 --> 00:33:12,830
reasonable?

673
00:33:13,500 --> 00:33:15,110
And are

674
00:33:15,110 --> 00:33:16,500
the construction methods

675
00:33:16,500 --> 00:33:17,790
suited to the terrain?

676
00:33:17,900 --> 00:33:19,050
The supply department.

677
00:33:19,050 --> 00:33:20,590
Our materials and equipment

678
00:33:20,590 --> 00:33:21,700
are all provided by them.

679
00:33:21,700 --> 00:33:23,420
Could there be quality defects

680
00:33:23,420 --> 00:33:24,180
and aging?

681
00:33:24,270 --> 00:33:25,050
The construction team.

682
00:33:25,050 --> 00:33:26,970
Were there any operating errors,

683
00:33:27,030 --> 00:33:28,260
improper installation,

684
00:33:28,260 --> 00:33:29,180
or violations

685
00:33:29,260 --> 00:33:30,700
of safety procedures?

686
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:31,740
Do you remember

687
00:33:32,150 --> 00:33:33,550
how distracted Dad was

688
00:33:33,660 --> 00:33:35,220
when he came home that day?

689
00:33:35,220 --> 00:33:36,030
I suggested a toast,

690
00:33:36,030 --> 00:33:37,490
but he didn't even hear me.

691
00:33:38,550 --> 00:33:39,260
I really think

692
00:33:39,260 --> 00:33:41,390
he must have discovered something.

693
00:33:43,630 --> 00:33:44,900
Do you think

694
00:33:46,830 --> 00:33:48,670
this explosion

695
00:33:49,590 --> 00:33:51,150
wasn't an accident at all?

696
00:33:55,070 --> 00:33:55,930
How about this?

697
00:33:56,310 --> 00:33:57,070
While we're sorting through

698
00:33:57,070 --> 00:33:58,460
Dad's belongings
over the next couple of days,

699
00:33:58,460 --> 00:33:59,590
let's look around

700
00:33:59,630 --> 00:34:01,030
and see if we can find

701
00:34:01,150 --> 00:34:02,580
the flange fragments.

702
00:34:02,980 --> 00:34:03,830
Look.

703
00:34:03,940 --> 00:34:06,030
I've been keeping a record

704
00:34:06,030 --> 00:34:07,070
ever since I started working.

705
00:34:07,070 --> 00:34:07,500
Dad also

706
00:34:07,500 --> 00:34:08,889
kept a work notebook.

707
00:34:09,110 --> 00:34:10,219
If we find it,

708
00:34:10,820 --> 00:34:12,380
there might be clues.

709
00:34:13,030 --> 00:34:13,889
How about this?

710
00:34:14,159 --> 00:34:16,380
You stay home
and take care of Mom tomorrow.

711
00:34:16,380 --> 00:34:18,550
I'll go to Dad's office to pack up

712
00:34:19,150 --> 00:34:20,699
and see if I can find them.

713
00:35:38,510 --> 00:35:39,300
Shan.

714
00:35:39,990 --> 00:35:42,250
I know you're going
to work in Guangdong.

715
00:35:42,500 --> 00:35:43,540
I support you.

716
00:35:44,030 --> 00:35:44,780
Go for it.

717
00:36:13,320 --> 00:36:16,350
[Safety Management Organizational Chart]

718
00:36:16,450 --> 00:36:17,630
[Construction Schedule]

719
00:36:19,260 --> 00:36:20,070
Captain He.

720
00:36:19,850 --> 00:36:23,710
[Construction Team]

721
00:36:21,150 --> 00:36:21,950
Secretary Hu.

722
00:36:22,030 --> 00:36:24,180
Director Wan wants you
to attend an emergency meeting.

723
00:36:24,180 --> 00:36:24,990
Is it urgent?

724
00:36:25,180 --> 00:36:25,910
Yes.

725
00:36:26,380 --> 00:36:27,030
Let's go then.

726
00:36:27,030 --> 00:36:27,660
Let's go.

727
00:36:28,860 --> 00:36:30,150
What's the meeting about?

728
00:36:29,010 --> 00:36:34,350
[Construction Schedule]

729
00:36:30,180 --> 00:36:31,220
It's about the Project 713

730
00:36:31,220 --> 00:36:32,470
explosion accident.

731
00:36:37,370 --> 00:36:45,210
[Director's Office]

732
00:36:43,430 --> 00:36:44,110
Ying?

733
00:36:46,340 --> 00:36:47,400
What are you doing?

734
00:36:48,300 --> 00:36:48,950
Mr. Qi.

735
00:36:49,510 --> 00:36:50,470
I need your help.

736
00:36:51,660 --> 00:36:53,990
Then let's go to my office.

737
00:36:54,550 --> 00:36:55,210
Let's go.

738
00:36:55,620 --> 00:36:57,480
[Director's Office]
[Activity Room]

739
00:36:59,140 --> 00:37:00,400
Deputy Director Geng.

740
00:37:01,320 --> 00:37:02,580
Deputy Director Geng?

741
00:37:03,070 --> 00:37:04,330
Deputy Director Geng.

742
00:37:04,470 --> 00:37:05,870
There's a tricky problem

743
00:37:06,430 --> 00:37:07,910
that only you can resolve.

744
00:37:06,760 --> 00:37:12,400
[Infrastructure Department]

745
00:37:08,510 --> 00:37:09,420
Hurry, Deputy Director Geng.

746
00:37:09,420 --> 00:37:10,190
Okay.

747
00:37:12,590 --> 00:37:15,400
[Finance Department]

748
00:37:16,080 --> 00:37:16,870
What's wrong?

749
00:37:16,870 --> 00:37:18,130
Deputy Director Geng.

750
00:37:18,170 --> 00:37:19,230
I'm busy right now.

751
00:37:26,870 --> 00:37:33,400
[Director's Office]
[Activity Room

752
00:37:28,720 --> 00:37:29,980
Deputy Director Geng.

753
00:37:29,990 --> 00:37:32,000
-It's tricky. Hurry up.
-Okay, okay.

754
00:37:32,000 --> 00:37:32,890
My back.

755
00:37:36,070 --> 00:37:37,780
Secretary Hu called He Jianchuan

756
00:37:37,780 --> 00:37:38,990
in for the Project 713

757
00:37:38,990 --> 00:37:40,180
accident meeting?

758
00:37:42,700 --> 00:37:44,200
Usually, for this kind of meeting,

759
00:37:44,200 --> 00:37:46,110
they would notify the technical staff

760
00:37:46,110 --> 00:37:47,590
and the family of the deceased.

761
00:37:47,590 --> 00:37:49,320
But neither of us was notified.

762
00:37:49,740 --> 00:37:51,180
This is a bit strange.

763
00:37:52,430 --> 00:37:53,340
Do you think

764
00:37:54,150 --> 00:37:55,070
they'll make a decision

765
00:37:55,070 --> 00:37:56,820
that goes against our family?

766
00:38:01,150 --> 00:38:02,250
Where are they having the meeting?

767
00:38:02,250 --> 00:38:03,580
The director's office.

768
00:38:03,990 --> 00:38:04,660
I'll go take a look.

769
00:38:04,660 --> 00:38:05,380
Mr. Qi,

770
00:38:06,150 --> 00:38:07,950
they said it's a secret meeting.

771
00:38:08,150 --> 00:38:09,480
Even my mom can't get in.

772
00:38:09,550 --> 00:38:11,010
How are you going to get in?

773
00:38:13,260 --> 00:38:13,950
I...

774
00:38:21,770 --> 00:38:22,620
I have an idea.

775
00:38:23,590 --> 00:38:25,150
The city has tasked
the municipal regulatory bureau

776
00:38:25,150 --> 00:38:27,010
and the Wugang County Government

777
00:38:27,430 --> 00:38:30,380
with leading a task force,
and the investigation has begun.

778
00:38:30,380 --> 00:38:32,430
We need to decide today

779
00:38:33,110 --> 00:38:35,040
who bears primary responsibility

780
00:38:35,130 --> 00:38:36,730
for the Project 713 accident

781
00:38:37,150 --> 00:38:40,260
and Chen Fu's death,

782
00:38:40,630 --> 00:38:42,960
so we're prepared for the investigation.

783
00:39:09,700 --> 00:39:10,780
The AC is broken.

784
00:39:11,110 --> 00:39:11,910
Wait a minute.

785
00:39:16,860 --> 00:39:18,180
Send an electric fan

786
00:39:18,180 --> 00:39:20,240
to the director's office right away.

787
00:39:26,700 --> 00:39:27,820
Ji, come here.

788
00:39:27,850 --> 00:39:28,550
Where are you going?

789
00:39:28,550 --> 00:39:30,070
The AC in the director's office is broken.

790
00:39:30,070 --> 00:39:31,330
I'm bringing him a fan.

791
00:39:31,860 --> 00:39:32,510
Well,

792
00:39:32,660 --> 00:39:33,740
I need to see the director.

793
00:39:33,740 --> 00:39:34,950
Give it to me. I'll take it in for you.

794
00:39:34,950 --> 00:39:36,280
Okay. Thank you, Mr. Qi.

795
00:39:42,910 --> 00:39:43,700
Why is it you?

796
00:39:43,700 --> 00:39:44,590
T-They called me

797
00:39:44,590 --> 00:39:46,110
to bring a fan

798
00:39:46,110 --> 00:39:47,570
to the director's office.

799
00:39:47,700 --> 00:39:49,150
Okay, come in.

800
00:39:53,590 --> 00:39:54,390
Director Wan,

801
00:39:54,820 --> 00:39:56,480
you're having a meeting here?

802
00:39:56,800 --> 00:39:57,330
Then I...

803
00:40:14,070 --> 00:40:14,740
Hello?

804
00:40:16,510 --> 00:40:17,510
Wrong number.

805
00:40:17,630 --> 00:40:19,300
This is not the finance department.

806
00:40:19,300 --> 00:40:20,100
Wrong number.

807
00:40:28,550 --> 00:40:30,420
Director Wan, is this speed okay?

808
00:40:30,910 --> 00:40:31,780
You guys continue your meeting.

809
00:40:31,780 --> 00:40:32,910
I'll head out first.

810
00:40:45,030 --> 00:40:47,370
Our plant
is at a critical point right now.

811
00:40:47,740 --> 00:40:49,800
We need to quickly reach a conclusion

812
00:40:49,950 --> 00:40:51,610
on Chen Fu's accidental death

813
00:40:52,740 --> 00:40:54,340
in the Project 713 incident,

814
00:40:55,920 --> 00:40:57,660
hold a plant-wide meeting,

815
00:40:58,420 --> 00:41:00,630
and get our story straight for the public.

816
00:41:00,630 --> 00:41:02,160
Director, please go ahead.

817
00:41:02,740 --> 00:41:04,260
The design was sound,

818
00:41:04,300 --> 00:41:07,180
and there were no problems with
the construction equipment or materials.

819
00:41:07,180 --> 00:41:09,610
So the problem must have been
with the way the work was carried out.

820
00:41:09,610 --> 00:41:11,290
In all my years of experience,

821
00:41:11,470 --> 00:41:12,660
Chen Fu

822
00:41:12,740 --> 00:41:13,910
was a stubborn man

823
00:41:14,030 --> 00:41:16,910
who always had his own ideas
and refused to listen to others.

824
00:41:16,910 --> 00:41:17,910
So

825
00:41:18,380 --> 00:41:19,470
Chen Fu should be held

826
00:41:19,470 --> 00:41:21,110
fully responsible for the accident.
